2ae/steering/2\"},{\"author\":\"uid:1000\",\"body\":\"OVERSEER (post-failure insurance, applies to any future attempt): the previous attempt did all the work — authored container/, ran the full 64-minute build, wrote the receipt — then exited WITHOUT committing, and the driver failed it at ownership validation (\\\"agent left uncommitted changes; commit the task before ownership validation\\\"). Your final acts, in order, MUST be: (1) run the acceptance argv yourself and see it pass; (2) git add ONLY paths inside your conflict domains (container/, results/receipts/); (3) git commit with a descriptive message; (4) verify `git status --porcelain` is empty before you finish. Note the flashnext:dev image and its layers already exist in podman storage from the prior attempt — a re-run of build.sh should be fast via layer cache; do not prune or rebuild from scratch.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-29T07:11:19.614Z\",\"id\":4,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-29T07:11:19.614Z\",\"url\":\"local://campaign/01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae/steering/4\"}],\"attemptReceipt\":{\"lateRecheckCommentIds\":[4],\"preparedCommentIds\":[2],\"recheckTruncated\":false,\"rechecked\":true,\"source\":{\"kind\":\"local-jsonl\",\"path\":\"/home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/steering/01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae/steering-v1.jsonl\",\"preparedCursor\":2,\"recheckedCursor\":4,\"registrationId\":\"01a04c1f-4605-7823-9eac-475e99b842ae\"}},\"machineDiagnoses\":[],\"machineOutcomes\":[]}}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1787987897774}}
