git4cff872c.rocm7.14.0 (the exact\n      companion pip resolves for torch 2.13.0), rocm-sdk-devel for the HIP compiler;\n      torchaudio omitted, not downgraded\n    - finding: the generic torch/torchvision wheels ship no device kernels — first launch\n      dies hipErrorInvalidImage until amd-torch-device-gfx1151 / amd-torchvision-device-gfx1151\n      / rocm-sdk-device-gfx1151 are installed; pinned too\n    - mecattaf/vllm branch flashnext cloned --depth 1 and built from source\n      (editable, --no-build-isolation, PYTORCH_ROCM_ARCH=gfx1151); a bind-mounted\n      checkout over /opt/vllm plus host ccache/pip caches (build.sh) make one-line\n      patch rebuilds incremental and the image enterable for edit-and-restart\n    - container/rootfs/ overlay COPYs into site-packages (fn_ instruments land importable)\n    - /opt/flashnext/build-info.json records fork commit, torch, triton, build time\n    \n    build.sh: packaging tests first, podman build flashnext:dev, receipt\n    results/receipts/build.json (fail status on any error). Attempt-2 fix per the\n    machine diagnosis: host ccache/pip cache defaults moved from $REPO_ROOT/.build/\n    to ${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-$HOME/.cache}/flashnext/{ccache,pip} so the worktree never\n    gains untracked files outside container/ and results/receipts/; overrides\n    FN_CCACHE_DIR / FN_PIP_CACHE_DIR and the podman --volume wiring unchanged.\n    No log files are written into the repo. Receipt banked: status pass, wall-clock\n    839 s; image verified on the GPU — kernels launch, fp8 storage cast finite,\n    Qwen4ExpForConditionalGeneration registered, block-FP8 MoE admitted on gfx1151.\n\n container/Containerfile     | 147 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n container/build.sh          | 118 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n container/rootfs/.keep      |   3 +\n results/receipts/build.json |  14 +++++\n 4 files changed, 282 insertions(+)\n=== d89f338f1e74622415022809f9becb28b73f86fa ===\ncommit d89f338f1e74622415